Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.64,0:11:52.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是哥登医生  我不会伤害你  我要帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Dr. Gordon. I'm not gonna hurt you, I wanna help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.72,0:11:54.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你何不  - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why don't you... - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:57.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心点  马克思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful, Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.64,0:12:00.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后  马克思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back off, Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.36,0:12:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克莉丝丹  刀子放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kristen, put the scalpel down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.96,0:12:06.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人会伤害你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody is gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.96,0:12:10.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五  六\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five, six
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.76,0:12:14.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去拿十字架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab your crucifix
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.20,0:12:16.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七  八\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven, eight
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.32,0:12:19.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彻夜不眠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better stay up late
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.48,0:12:21.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九  十\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine, ten
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.64,0:12:24.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never, never...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.44,0:12:25.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远别睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never sleep again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.64,0:12:35.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪里学会那首童谣的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you learn that rhyme?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.24,0:12:51.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我谈谈那些孩子的状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me about the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.92,0:12:55.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,某方面而言  他们可说是幸存者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, they're survivors in a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.68,0:13:00.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都有严重的睡眠障碍  失眠  猝睡症跟尿床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all severely sleep disordered. Insomnia, narcolepsy, bed-wetting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.32,0:13:02.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 做恶梦是共同的症状  - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But the nightmares are the common thread. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.00,0:13:07.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们似乎有集体幻想  一个恶鬼  我不知道该如何形容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They seem to share a group delusion, a bogeyman, for lack of a better word.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.44,0:13:11.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都饱受精神折磨  想尽办法不让自己睡着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're so traumatized, they'll do almost anything not to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.32,0:13:13.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:19.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个月前在费尔悠死了一个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lost a kid about a month ago to Fairview.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.60,0:13:21.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道他怎么拿到刀子的  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know where he got the razors,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.50,0:13:23.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他割下眼皮只为了不想睡着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he cut off his eyelids to stay awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.44,0:13:27.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 天啊  - 那些孩子都吓坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, God. - Shook the kids up pretty badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.32,0:13:30.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了  你处理新来的病患很有一套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, by the way, that was really great work with the new patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.56,0:13:32.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就实习生来说真的很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty smooth for an intern.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.40,0:13:34.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对模式恶梦有些经验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have had some experience with pattern nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.44,0:13:40.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我得走了  - 好的  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I've got to get going. - Okay, well....
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.24,0:13:41.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来帮你捡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me help you with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:47.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢  - 不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.56,0:13:51.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得去找马克思  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, uh, be sure that you check in with Max...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.92,0:13:54.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会好好带你参观这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and he'll give you the whole 25-cent tour and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:56.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好  待会儿见  - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, I'll see you later. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:13:58.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃  汤普森小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, um, Miss Thompson?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.56,0:14:00.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你可以叫我南希  - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can call me Nancy. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.76,0:14:05.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫我尼尔  好吗  那首童谣是怎么一回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You call me Neil, all right? What was that nursery rhyme all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.48,0:14:12.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子们会念那首童谣赶走恶鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was just something that the kids say to keep the bogeyman away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:38.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之那是团体治疗室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, that's group therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.84,0:14:42.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一区专门用来做团体治疗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This whole wing is devoted to the program. Um....
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.80,0:14:46.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你暂时可以用这间办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess, yeah, you can use this office for the time being, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.12,0:14:48.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没问题  - 太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This will be fine. - All right, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.04,0:14:52.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周末前我会想办法  帮你找个私人办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I'll have you set up in your own space by the end of the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.48,0:14:55.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,病房在这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, the patients' rooms are down this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.08,0:15:03.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是菲利普  我们都叫他游魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Phillip. We call him "The Walker."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.28,0:15:06.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么  - 因为我会梦游\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why is that? - Because I sleepwalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.96,0:15:08.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那很正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfectly normal event...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.28,0:15:12.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这里的名医  喜欢没事提出一大堆理论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that our illustrious staff loves to theorize about endlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.68,0:15:14.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲利普  这位是南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phillip, this is Nancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.48,0:15:17.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎光临蛇窟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, welcome to the snake pit. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.28,0:15:20.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.00,0:15:22.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.60,0:15:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上那应该是木雕  但他们不让我用刀子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They really ought to be carved out of wood, but they won't let me have a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.68,0:15:29.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可能会  你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might, you know, pfft!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.84,0:15:36.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个懒鬼是金凯德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, this lump over here, this is Kincaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:38.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你仔细看好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I want you to take a good look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.72,0:15:42.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他常被关进禁闭室  你看到他的机会大概不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gets thrown in the quiet room so often, you probably won't see a lot of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.80,0:15:44.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧  小帅哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't that right, cool breeze?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.56,0:15:48.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  我会那么做  只是不想常看到你的丑脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, I do it so I don't have to look at your ugly face all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.60,0:15:50.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  我也爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I love you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.52,0:15:52.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice meeting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.32,0:15:58.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都是好孩子  但别被骗了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, they're really good kids but, uh, don't let them fool you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.76,0:16:02.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们很危险  对自己跟别人都是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're dangerous, to themselves and to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.20,0:16:11.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨  乔伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.88,0:16:15.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.56,0:16:18.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 玛西  你还好吗  - 我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Marcie, how you doing? - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.48,0:16:19.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这些要送去C区病房  - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- These going to C Ward? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.96,0:16:21.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  我帮你推过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, I'll walk you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.76,0:16:24.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待会儿见  乔伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you later, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.12,0:16:36.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帕克太太  克莉丝丹曾出现异常状况吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Parker, was Kristen acting any different?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.24,0:16:39.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在她企图自杀前  你有注意到不寻常的事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you notice anything strange before she made the attempt?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.76,0:16:41.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克莉丝丹一向怪里怪气的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kristen specializes in strangeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.96,0:16:44.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我花了不少钱让她看精神科医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've spent thousands on psychiatrists.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.64,0:16:48.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她一直都会做恶梦吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did she always have nightmares?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.68,0:16:51.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  没收她的信用卡后  状况才越来越糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, they've gotten worse since I took away her credit cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.16,0:16:53.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是认真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.44,0:16:55.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤普森小姐  我不知道你为什么要找我谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Thompson, I don't know what you want from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.88,0:16:56.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是想知道答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just some answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.08,0:16:59.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多孩子都住院了  不只是克莉丝丹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are other kids involved, not just Kristen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.44,0:17:00.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都是好孩子  非常聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All good kids, smart kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.04,0:17:04.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我真的很遗憾  但你才是专家  我什么都不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm sorry to hear that but you're the experts on this, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.36,0:17:08.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我知道发生了什么事  一定会告诉你  相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I had any insight into any of this, I would share them with you, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.40,0:17:09.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信你一定会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:11.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  我得去一趟市区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you'll excuse me, I have to get downtown.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.12,0:17:14.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要她的一些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll need to get her things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.32,0:17:16.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把她的东西都放在行李箱里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have them packed in a suitcase.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.28,0:17:18.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泰瑞莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theresa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.56,0:17:19.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泰瑞莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theresa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.80,0:17:21.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请让我自己去拿  我不介意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get them, please, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.16,0:17:25.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上楼后第一个房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the first door at the top of the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.56,0:21:47.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.68,0:21:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.88,0:22:12.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.72,0:22:15.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.28,0:22:31.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是你  - 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.32,0:22:32.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.60,0:22:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快帮助我们逃出去  克莉丝丹  快一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get us back out, Kristen, do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.28,0:22:56.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前我住在这间房子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to Iive in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.20,0:22:58.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我梦到的房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's just a house I dream about.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.48,0:23:04.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那样做过吗  把别人拉到你的梦中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever done that before, pull someone into your dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.12,0:23:09.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还小的时候  应该只有四  五岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was a little girl, like 4 or 5...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.48,0:23:12.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我做了恶梦  总是会把我爸拉入梦里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if I had a nightmare, I would always bring my dad in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.92,0:23:15.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶梦总会变得比较不可怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dreams would always get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.16,0:23:20.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隔天他会跟我说起  他以为是他在做梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He used to tell me about it the next day. He used to think they were his dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.96,0:23:24.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哈哈 - 你何时不再那样做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ha, ha. - And when did that stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.52,0:23:26.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还小的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was still a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.72,0:23:29.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸妈离婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My folks got divorced.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.32,0:23:32.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过了一阵子  我以为那是我的想像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And after a while, I just thought I imagined the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.84,0:23:34.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想那不是幻想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.80,0:23:37.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是非常棒的天分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an amazing gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.84,0:23:41.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我梦里的那个人  他真的存在  对不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man in my dreams, he's real, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.44,0:23:47.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他真的存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.72,0:23:52.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  大家都来了  在这里我们必须直言不讳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, group's in session. Straight talk only in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.24,0:23:55.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我要跟大家介绍一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today, I'd like to start getting us acquainted...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.84,0:23:58.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的新工作人员  南希  汤普森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with our new staff member, Nancy Thompson.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.72,0:24:00.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家跟她打个招呼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's make her all welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.28,0:24:01.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好  南希 - 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, Nancy. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.84,0:24:03.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好  南希  - 南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, Nancy. - Hey, Nancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.20,0:24:06.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你见过菲利普跟金凯德  当然还有克莉丝丹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you've already met Phillip and Kincaid and, of course, Kristen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.76,0:24:10.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人何不跟南希做一下自我介绍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about the rest of you all tell Nancy something about yourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.20,0:24:15.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,威尔  从你开始好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will, how about you first?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.12,0:24:20.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是威尔史  坦顿  你应该看得出来  我发生了意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, I'm Will Stanton and, um, I've had a little accident, as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.88,0:24:21.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果必须坐轮椅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ended up in this chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.08,0:24:23.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意外个头啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Accident, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.96,0:24:26.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为在这里必须直言不讳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought this was supposed to be straight talk in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.72,0:24:27.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是跳楼又怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, so he took a jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.92,0:24:31.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少他没有跟那些流氓共用针头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least, he wasn't sticking needles in his arm with a bunch of lowlifes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.48,0:24:33.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说了  金凯德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save it, Kincaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.72,0:24:35.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 珍妮佛 - 嗯哼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jennifer? - Um, ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.92,0:24:37.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是珍妮佛  考菲德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Jennifer Caulfield.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.72,0:24:42.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开这里后  我要到洛杉矶当演员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, um, as soon as I get out of here, I'm going to Los Angeles to be an actress.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.24,0:24:43.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要当电视明星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna be on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.04,0:24:46.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  《有钱疯子的人生》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Lifestyles of the Rich and Psychotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.96,0:24:47.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.04,0:24:52.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是乔伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.56,0:24:56.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他以前在学校参加辩论社  现在话却不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He used to be a debater in school, but now he doesn't talk much.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.76,0:24:58.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是泰纶怀特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Taryn White.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.16,0:25:03.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会来这里  因为这里比少年感化院好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only reason I'm in here is because it's a better deal than juvie hall...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.92,0:25:06.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我遇到一些怪事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...also, because I'm going through some very strange shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.44,0:25:08.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.96,0:25:11.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都会做恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, everybody has bad dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.64,0:25:14.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能插句话帮大家节省一下时间吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I interject something here just to save us all some time?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.60,0:25:15.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然可以  菲利普  说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, Phillip, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.96,0:25:17.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据我们慈悲的医生的说法  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, according to our kind hosts...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.04,0:25:23.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的梦是种团体精神病  像是一种温和的集体歇斯底里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...our dreams are a group psychosis, sort of a mellow mass hysteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.28,0:25:27.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人在乎我们彼此认识前就梦到这个家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fact we dreamt about this guy before we met doesn't seem to impress anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.56,0:25:28.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对  - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.00,0:25:33.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是在绕圈圈  费尽心力却看不到成果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we go in circles, making minimal progress with maximum effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.36,0:25:37.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非认清梦境的本质  否则你是不会有任何进展的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't make any progress until you recognize your dreams for what they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.80,0:25:39.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们的本质是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.52,0:25:41.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罪恶感的副产物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The by-products of guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.04,0:25:47.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心理创伤  源自道德冲突跟性欲旺盛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Psychological scars, stemming from moral conflicts and overt sexuality.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.28,0:25:50.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了  现在我的小弟弟害死我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, great, now it's my dick that's killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.72,0:25:59.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我再来会发生什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me what's supposed to be happening again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.40,0:26:02.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  你会被犬魔攻击  快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, you're being attacked by the bog demon. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.32,0:26:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 十四点  - 那不算数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Uh, 14. - Doesn't count.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.08,0:26:07.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得照规定来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to say the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.96,0:26:09.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这太蠢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.32,0:26:11.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.88,0:26:19.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以精灵王子罗雷克之名  魔鬼快快退去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the name of Lowrek, Prince of Elves, demon, begone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.16,0:26:23.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了  你征服了魔鬼  但你的马被困在沼泽里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, you conquered the demon but your horse is sinking in the bog.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.84,0:26:25.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.88,0:26:28.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我上床睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I go to bed...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.64,0:26:31.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天一早我会有新的马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and get a new horse in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.00,0:26:36.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以拿到什么  下咒昏睡或死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, how do I score that? Enchanted slumber or death?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.28,0:26:39.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  孩子们  熄灯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, fellas, lights out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.60,0:26:42.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 噢  马克思  - 噢  马克思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, Max. - "Oh, Max."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.56,0:26:43.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们知道规定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.84,0:26:45.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对  - 来吧  乔伊  你也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Come on, Joey, you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.52,0:26:48.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次我们玩得正开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every time we get a good game going...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.20,0:26:50.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 熄灯时间就到了 - 嗯嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...it's always lights out. - Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.68,0:26:57.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.04,0:27:03.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 大家晚安  - 晚安  马克思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good night, fellas. - Good night, Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.40,0:27:10.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  今晚你值第一班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, you get first shift tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.52,0:27:12.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少来了  昨晚我值第一班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on, I had it last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.04,0:27:16.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  别忘了  千万别闭上眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, just remember, keep your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.04,0:27:20.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍有动静  你得叫醒我  好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And one whimper and you wake me up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.04,0:27:38.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这里真的很不错  - 你没来过这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is nice. - You've never been here before?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.24,0:27:41.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我想他们开幕时我还在念书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, um, I think they opened this when I was at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.72,0:27:43.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春森市最棒的泰国餐厅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Best Thai food in Springwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.08,0:27:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是春森市唯一的泰国餐厅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, it's the only Thai food in Springwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.32,0:27:49.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你爸妈还住在这里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, do your parents still live around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.28,0:27:53.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈过世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.56,0:27:56.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在睡梦中断气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She, uh, died in her sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.44,0:27:57.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.40,0:28:00.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸跟我  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father and l, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.56,0:28:04.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后我们的生活整个乱了套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, things just seemed to fall apart after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.44,0:28:06.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来你应该很不好过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like a rough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.76,0:28:08.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.84,0:28:14.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼尔  如果我告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neil, what if I told you...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.28,0:28:20.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的病患因为他们的梦身陷险境呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that, um, your patients are in real physical danger from their dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.56,0:28:25.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶梦只是真实生活问题的反射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The nightmares are nothing but a symptom of the real problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.44,0:28:29.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  先暂除排除那样的可能性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, well, then let's just eliminate the symptom for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.60,0:28:34.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 使用去梦眠  - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- With Hypnocil? - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.20,0:28:35.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要我开  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to prescribe...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.96,0:28:39.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实验性心理药物给一群有自杀倾向的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...an experimental psychoactive drug to a bunch of suicidal teenagers?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.96,0:28:42.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到我们控制住状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just until we get things under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.24,0:28:45.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去除梦境不是件开玩笑的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dream deprivation is nothing to fool around with.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.36,0:28:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也不该使用那样的药物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no business taking it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.44,0:28:51.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前我跟他们一样  尼尔  我了解他们的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to be like them, Neil. I know what they're going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.28,0:28:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So do l.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.64,0:28:57.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟我说他们是幸存者  事实的确是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You told me they were survivors and they all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.72,0:29:00.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他们能撑多久全靠我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how much longer they survive is up to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.80,0:29:05.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Nancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.32,0:29:07.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,答案是不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The answer is no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.48,0:30:26.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲利普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phillip.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.68,0:30:30.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲利普  醒一醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phillip, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.60,0:30:38.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你梦游愉快  混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a nice stroll, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.36,0:31:27.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛  你在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.60,0:31:29.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样  老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.28,0:31:31.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  你疯了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.56,0:31:36.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死  他在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit, what is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.48,0:31:38.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去找人帮忙  找人帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get help! Get help!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.60,0:31:41.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲利普  菲利普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phillip! Phillip!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.32,0:31:48.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲利普  不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phillip, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.52,0:31:53.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.04,0:31:55.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.96,0:32:00.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲利普  菲利普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phillip! Phillip!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.20,0:32:02.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲利普  菲利普  不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phillip! Phillip, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.72,0:32:04.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲利普  不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phillip, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.68,0:32:07.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别那么做  不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do it, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.52,0:32:10.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲利普  别那么做  菲利普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phillip, don't do it! Phillip!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.88,0:32:12.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.48,0:32:14.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲利普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phillip!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.24,0:32:17.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 菲利普  - 菲利普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Phillip! - Phillip!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.84,0:32:19.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 菲利普  - 菲利普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Phillip! - Phillip!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.08,0:32:21.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别跳  - 菲利普  不要跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't jump! - Phillip, don't jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.76,0:32:25.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲利普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phillip!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.40,0:32:26.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不要跳 - 啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't you jump! - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.88,0:32:47.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要跟大家谈谈昨晚发生的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want us to talk about what happened last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.28,0:32:51.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要大家说出自己的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want us to all get our feelings out in the open.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.88,0:32:55.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不够坚强  所以他死了  就那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wasn't strong enough so he got wasted, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.72,0:32:58.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就那样  你是那么想的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all? Is that what you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.40,0:33:00.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他无法撑下来  所以他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He couldn't hack it so he got nailed, period.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.08,0:33:05.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  超级硬汉  你打算撑多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, big, tough bad ass. How long are you gonna last?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.48,0:33:07.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会撑得比你们都久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna last longer than any of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.28,0:33:10.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽量反抗吧  他就是希望你们能那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, just go ahead and fight because that's what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.28,0:33:12.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谁  - 你觉得是谁呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who? - Who do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.52,0:33:14.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does he want?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.24,0:33:17.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要我们互相残杀  这样才会变得软弱  方便他下手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To turn us against each other so we'll be weak, easy prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.32,0:33:19.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 胡说八道  - 不  她是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Horse shit. - No, she's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.36,0:33:21.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想大家都没讲到重点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we're all missing the point here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.16,0:33:25.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲利普的死是梦游意外  就那么简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phillip's death was a sleepwalking accident, nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.80,0:33:27.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.00,0:33:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到他站在上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could see him up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.84,0:33:31.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的脸  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His face...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.40,0:33:35.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一直都是清醒的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was wide awake all the way down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.28,0:33:38.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是自杀  菲利普撑不下去  他放弃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then it was suicide. Phillip quit, he gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.44,0:33:39.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔伊说他不是自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joey says it wasn't suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.88,0:33:42.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说  乔伊  菲利普是自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me, Joey, Phillip killed himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.80,0:33:45.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么做太懦弱了  一点意义都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, that's a cowardly thing. That's an empty thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.40,0:33:47.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他让自己失望  也让我们失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He let himself down. He let all of us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.84,0:33:51.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是谋杀  你还不懂吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was murder. Can't you understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.28,0:33:53.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个混蛋杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That bastard murdered him!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.44,0:33:55.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想再听下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna listen to any more of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.84,0:33:57.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们还要将自己的软弱  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much longer are you going to go on...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.88,0:34:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,归咎给恶梦多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...blaming your dreams for your own weaknesses?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.44,0:34:03.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还要指控  - 够了  金凯德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How much longer you gonna keep throw... - That's enough, Kincaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.92,0:34:07.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚的意外不能重演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There will be no repeat occurrences of last night's events.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.76,0:34:11.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从现在开始  睡觉时你们的房门都得上锁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From now on your doors will be locked during sleeping hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.88,0:34:14.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会在晚上开安眠药给大家吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll start a policy of evening sedation for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.60,0:34:17.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你的  谁敢对我下药  我一定会揍扁他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he fuck you will. Anybody who tries drugs on me, gets his ass kicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.12,0:34:21.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚你待在禁闭室  孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just bought yourself a night in the quiet room, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.32,0:34:24.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快坐下  - 去你的  你才要坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now, sit down. - Fuck you, you sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.32,0:34:26.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 冷静点  金凯德  - 谁都别想叫我睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Easy, Kincaid. - Nobody is gonna put me to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.92,0:34:28.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离我远一点  别碰我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away from me. Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.64,0:34:31.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要睡觉  谁都别想叫我睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna go to sleep. Nobody gonna put me to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.48,0:34:34.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't going to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.20,0:34:35.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你的手  我不要睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your hands... I ain't gonna sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.12,0:34:37.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待在位置上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay in your seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.48,0:34:39.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你的手拿开  我不要  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your hands off me, I don't wanna...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.48,0:34:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚我们得使用安眠药  从他开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll begin sedation tonight starting with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.48,0:34:44.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能那么做  他们会无力对抗恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't. They'll be defenseless against their dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.40,0:34:45.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们就是需要那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's precisely what they need.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.04,0:34:49.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有打扰地好好睡一觉  会释放出所有负面能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some uninterrupted REM sleep to release all that negative energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.84,0:34:53.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊莉莎白  我要开去梦眠给他  那是抑制做梦的药物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth, I'm prescribing Hypnocil. It's a dream suppressant.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.92,0:34:57.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道那是什么  我只是不敢相信你会那么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what it is. I just can't believe what I'm hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.28,0:34:59.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她是怎么说服你的  - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What has she talked you into? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.28,0:35:00.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是我的病人  由我来决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My patients, my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.92,0:35:03.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到答案前  我希望他们不再做梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want these dreams stopped till we get some answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.88,0:35:06.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.48,0:35:08.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有必要的话  我会直接去找卡佛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I'll go straight to Carver if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.88,0:35:11.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不支持我  就得批准我的辞呈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he'll either back me up or accept my resignation.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.36,0:35:13.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.96,0:35:17.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果出了问题  我要你负起责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if something goes wrong, I'll make sure that you're held responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.48,0:35:20.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说真的  负起全责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean that. Fully responsible.
