Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.60,0:41:53.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.56,0:41:56.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你要走了吗  - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you ready to go now? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.32,0:42:08.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你吃饱了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you finished?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.76,0:42:11.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  抱歉  我想我不饿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm sorry. I guess l, uh... I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.92,0:42:13.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.68,0:42:21.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这很漂亮  这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's pretty. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.68,0:42:27.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的马来西亚梦娃娃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my Malaysian dream doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.96,0:42:30.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该能带来美梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's supposed to bring good dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.48,0:42:33.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们的确需要美梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could use some of that right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.68,0:42:43.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前我总认为  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I used to think...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.92,0:42:48.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以为孩子们做一些事  改变他们的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... I could do something for the kids, make some kind of difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.68,0:42:51.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是现在他们一个一个消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they're slipping through my fingers, every one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.32,0:42:55.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你尽力在帮他们  尼尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're doing the best you can for them, Neil.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.64,0:42:58.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am l?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.60,0:43:00.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找不到答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm running out of answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.44,0:43:03.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梦游病人在高度戒备病房跳楼身亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A patient sleepwalks out of a high-security ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.08,0:43:05.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,单独待在房里的女孩死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A girl alone in a room dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.52,0:43:08.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不敢相信这是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe this is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.28,0:43:11.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全没有逻辑可言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing makes any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.92,0:43:17.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么或许你已经准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then maybe you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.32,0:43:19.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.48,0:43:22.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ruth.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.72,0:43:24.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.16,0:43:29.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你愿意放下你所学的一切  真的相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only if you're willing to put aside everything you've learned and trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.44,0:43:31.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做得到吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.20,0:43:36.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.88,0:43:40.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.60,0:43:42.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里我们得直言不讳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Straight talk only in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.80,0:43:44.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是团体治疗吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this group?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.52,0:43:46.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  非正式治疗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, yeah, unofficially.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.44,0:43:49.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快地我们的人数就不足以做团体治疗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty soon, there won't be enough of us left to call it "group."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.68,0:43:51.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  听着  各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, listen up, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.72,0:43:54.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希有话要说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy has something to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.84,0:43:56.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道谁想杀了你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know who's trying to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.12,0:43:59.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跟我们开玩笑  我们没那个心情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't humor us. We're not in the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.68,0:44:04.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他戴着肮脏的棕色帽子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wears a dirty, brown hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.72,0:44:06.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮肤严重烧伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's horribly burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.12,0:44:10.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的右手跟利刃一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has razors on his right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.40,0:44:14.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.92,0:44:18.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫佛莱迪·克鲁格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name is Freddy Krueger.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.64,0:44:22.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死前是个专杀孩童的凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a child murderer before he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.00,0:44:25.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他死后  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And after he died...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.76,0:44:28.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成了厉鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...well, he became something worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.48,0:44:32.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,六年前他杀了我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six years ago, he killed my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.16,0:44:34.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他差点杀了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He almost killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.92,0:44:36.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他为什么要追杀我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is he after us?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.68,0:44:38.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊  我们做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, what did we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.48,0:44:41.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题不在你们身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.44,0:44:45.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的爸妈跟我的爸妈将他活活烧死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your parents, my parents, they burned him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.88,0:44:49.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们得为他们做的事付出代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now we're paying for their sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.40,0:44:53.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是最后一批榆树街儿童\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the last of the Elm Street children.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.24,0:44:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸跟我妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom and Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.88,0:44:59.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那太疯狂了  他们从来没跟我提过这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, that's crazy. They never mentioned anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.48,0:45:02.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是喔  爸妈的确会跟孩子提这种事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, sure, that's the sort of thing parents tell their kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.64,0:45:04.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"晚安  宝贝  快祷告吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Good night, darling, say your prayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.72,0:45:08.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了  你爸跟我昨晚烧死一个疯子"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, oh, by the way, your father and I torched some maniac last night."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.48,0:45:10.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该怎么对付这个怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what do we do about this creep?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.04,0:45:12.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克莉丝丹是关键人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kristen is the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.64,0:45:16.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她有非常特别的天赋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She has a very special talent, a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.88,0:45:19.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我长大后就无法那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't been able to do that since I was a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.84,0:45:21.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那晚你就做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did it the other night.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.20,0:45:23.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was different.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.47,0:45:28.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不可能失去那样的天赋  你只是忘记如何使用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never lose a gift like that. You just forget how to use it
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.48,0:45:30.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你何不试试看呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about it, will you try?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.40,0:45:35.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都有这样的心灵力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of you have this inner strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.68,0:45:40.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在最美的梦里拥有的特殊力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some special power that you've had in your most wonderful dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.00,0:45:44.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以一起试着使用那样的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together, we can learn to use that power if we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.60,0:45:45.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的口气很像彼得潘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sound like Peter Pan.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.24,0:45:48.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得吗  保持心胸开阔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, open mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.76,0:45:50.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.96,0:45:54.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泰纶  麻烦你将窗帘拉上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, Taryn, would you pull the shades down please?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.84,0:45:58.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来做团体催眠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna try a little, uh, group hypnosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.20,0:46:13.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你们注视这个钟摆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you all to follow this pendulum with your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.60,0:46:17.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抛开其他的杂念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tune out everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.28,0:46:21.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注视着钟摆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing else exists but the pendulum.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.24,0:46:23.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带我们到那里去  克莉丝丹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take us there, Kristen.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.28,0:46:28.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,深呼吸  放轻松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breathe deeply and relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.40,0:46:30.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从脚趾开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starting with your toes,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.62,0:46:33.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放松一切  让身体不再感到紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}relax everything till there's no tension left in your bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.40,0:46:37.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,持续注视着钟摆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep following the pendulum.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.36,0:46:41.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们会发现自己累了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You find yourselves getting tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.24,0:46:45.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在真的很想  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing would feel better right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.00,0:46:51.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好深深地睡一觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...than a nice, long, deep sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.00,0:46:55.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要从五开始倒数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna count backwards from five.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.68,0:46:57.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倒数完毕  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I finish...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.44,0:47:02.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都会睡着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you will all be asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.12,0:47:06.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.84,0:47:08.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.72,0:47:10.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.44,0:47:12.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.20,0:47:26.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.72,0:47:28.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系  我们可以再试一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's okay, we'll try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.96,0:47:30.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休息一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody take five. Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.60,0:47:41.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我愿意这么做  让孩子们跟你觉得安心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was willing to go through with this for the kids' peace of mind and yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.52,0:47:44.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你得面对现实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but you're gonna have to face reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.40,0:47:52.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我是说真的  我很容易被催眠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm serious, I happen to be very susceptible to hypnosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.96,0:47:55.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 专业人士是那么跟我说的  - 什么专业人士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I've been told by professionals. - What professionals?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.64,0:47:56.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些专业人士在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are these professionals?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.16,0:48:00.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我指的专业人士是魔术师跟幻术家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, "professionals" as in, like, magic-users and illusionists.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.64,0:48:22.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  乔伊  我只是想跟你独处一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Joey, I just wanted to get you alone for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.44,0:48:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说  我真的很喜欢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, look, I really like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.24,0:48:29.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.28,0:48:30.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道这听起来很夸张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this sounds crazy...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.68,0:48:36.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我每天编藉口到病房看你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I make up excuses to come into the ward every day just to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.32,0:48:38.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的好可爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.48,0:48:44.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼尔  我们得再试一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neil, let's just try one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.68,0:48:47.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果还是不行  我保证我会  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it doesn't work, I promise I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.08,0:48:56.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.36,0:48:57.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到了哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where here?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.16,0:48:59.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们进入梦境里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in the dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.44,0:49:02.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不可能  我们还在团体治疗室里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, no, we're not. We're still here in the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.20,0:49:09.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在梦里我会走路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my dreams, I can walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.52,0:49:11.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的腿非常有力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My legs are strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.84,0:49:15.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在梦里我是大法师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my dreams, I am the wizard master.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.60,0:49:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试试看  克莉丝丹  在梦里你可以做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try something, Kristen. What can you do in your dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.56,0:49:43.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满分  观众为之疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A perfect score. The crowd goes wild. Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.88,0:49:46.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哈哈 - 该死  看我的厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ha, ha! - Fucking A, dig this.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.36,0:49:55.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金凯德  拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kincaid, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.24,0:49:56.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那让人很不安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's very unnerving.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.60,0:49:58.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们快看泰纶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, check out Taryn.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.84,0:50:01.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在梦里我是个美女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my dreams, I'm beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.80,0:50:04.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是个坏女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.60,0:50:08.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我这么做会惹上大麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I could get into a lot of trouble for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.84,0:50:14.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我知道你不会说的  对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I know you won't say anything, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.92,0:50:17.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我拉开拉链\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unzip me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.12,0:50:34.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢我的身材吗  乔伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you like my body, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.16,0:51:25.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了  乔伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.84,0:51:27.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舌头打结了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feeling tongue-tied?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.92,0:52:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.00,0:52:05.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他在附近  - 谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's close. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.20,0:52:06.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是佛莱迪吗  - 他在走廊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Freddy? - He's out in the halls.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.96,0:52:08.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 乔伊在哪里  - 佛莱迪抓走他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's Joey? - Freddy's got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.16,0:52:15.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家安静  你们听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quiet, everyone, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.84,0:52:24.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,房间变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The room's changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.88,0:52:26.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the heck is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.32,0:52:28.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 医生  - 发生了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Doctor... - What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.48,0:52:34.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离墙边远一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away from the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.76,0:52:56.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别慌张  安静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't panic! Quiet down!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.40,0:53:02.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊  救命啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.04,0:53:04.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这不是真的  - 哥登医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This isn't real! - Dr. Gordon!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.76,0:53:07.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  - 不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! - It's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.40,0:53:08.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安静  你们看门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quiet, the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.16,0:53:13.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.56,0:53:16.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔伊怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.40,0:53:18.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.96,0:53:21.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 蓝色警报  - 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Code blue. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.60,0:53:32.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他陷入重度昏迷  我们没办法治好他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in a deep coma. There's nothing we can do for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.72,0:53:34.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这令人无法原谅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is inexcusable.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.84,0:53:36.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,治疗并未经过授权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The session was unauthorized.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.72,0:53:38.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我不知情的状况下进行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was purposely conducted without my knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.08,0:53:41.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡佛医生  我们得采取必要行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unusual steps were called for, Dr. Carver.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.80,0:53:44.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该把你的话  转告给那孩子的爸妈吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what I should tell that young man's parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.40,0:53:46.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我了解你开实验性药物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand you prescribed a highly experimental drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.08,0:53:49.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡佛医生  他并非陷入昏迷  因为  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Carver, he's not in a coma because of...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.24,0:53:51.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小女孩  我不想听你的意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Young lady, your opinion is of no interest to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.64,0:53:53.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且根据希莫丝医生的说法  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Furthermore, according to Dr. Simms...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.76,0:53:56.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直在引发病人的恐慌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you've been creating panic among the patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.24,0:53:58.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那不是真的  - 哥登医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's not true. - Dr. Gordon.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.32,0:54:00.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四天来有两名病人自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the last four days, we've had two suicides.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.88,0:54:02.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在那个孩子陷入昏迷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that young man is in a coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.60,0:54:05.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信我们可以说  你的方法完全失败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's safe to say that your approach has failed, entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.44,0:54:09.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个都被解职了  我要你们今天就离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're both relieved of duty. I want you out of here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.72,0:54:16.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  尼尔  不过我恐怕这是你自找的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Neil. I'm afraid you brought it on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.08,0:54:21.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  伊莉莎白  拜托  拜托你试着帮这些孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For God's sake, Elizabeth, please. Will you please just try to help the kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.84,0:54:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能听他们说话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you listen to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.92,0:54:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当然会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.00,0:54:33.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.72,0:54:38.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一点办法都没有  现在我们帮不上忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is nothing that we can do. It's out of our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.24,0:55:18.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,修女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.32,0:56:22.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,修女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.44,0:56:38.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人在吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.84,0:56:49.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,修女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.76,0:57:03.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都是从这里开始的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where it began.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.36,0:57:06.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一区已经封闭多年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This wing has been closed for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.40,0:57:09.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前这是什么地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.20,0:57:10.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,炼狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.00,0:57:14.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们一手打造出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fashioned by the hands of men.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.64,0:57:18.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扭曲寂寞的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twisted, lonely souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.52,0:57:22.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最可怕的疯狂罪犯  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The worst of the criminally insane...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.36,0:57:26.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟动物一样被关在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...were locked up in here like animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.48,0:57:29.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里在四零年代被封闭了  不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This whole facility was shut down in the '40s, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.72,0:57:32.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是因为有丑闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some sort of scandal?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.12,0:57:35.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个年轻的女性工作人员  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A young girl on the staff...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.48,0:57:39.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放假时不小心被关在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...was accidentally locked in here over the holidays.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.04,0:57:44.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,病人将她藏起来好几天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The inmates kept her hidden for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.60,0:57:49.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不断地被强暴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was raped hundreds of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.00,0:57:53.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们发现她时  她已经奄奄一息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When they found her, she was barely alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.60,0:57:56.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且怀孕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and with child.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.84,0:58:00.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那女孩是亚曼达·克鲁格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That girl was Amanda Krueger.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.92,0:58:03.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她的孩子  - 佛莱迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Her child... - Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.56,0:58:08.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一堆疯子生下的私生子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bastard son of a hundred maniacs.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.36,0:58:12.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人说他遭到杀害  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some say he was murdered...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.52,0:58:14.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但一直没有找到尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...though no body was ever found.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.92,0:58:22.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前你提到要让他安息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said something before about laying him to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.88,0:58:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得找到他的遗骸  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must find the remains...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.16,0:58:30.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在圣地火化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and bury him in hallowed ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.48,0:58:38.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hallowed ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.04,0:58:40.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,修女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.92,0:58:47.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你只相信科学  医生  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If your only faith is science, doctor...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.60,0:58:52.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许该安息的人是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it may be you that's laid to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.64,0:58:57.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下  修女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.00,0:59:19.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放了他  你这个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go of him, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.88,0:59:26.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.28,0:59:39.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须进入梦境  我们别无选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to go in. We don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.88,0:59:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,害自己没命救不了那些孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Getting yourself killed won't help the kids at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.52,0:59:47.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我们有选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, we do have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.60,0:59:50.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你幻想中的修女说的没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, assuming your mysterious nun is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.64,0:59:53.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这星期我听过更奇怪的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've heard weirder things this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.72,0:59:56.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.36,0:59:59.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不论她是谁  她似乎比我更了解克鲁格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever she is, she does seem to know more about Krueger than I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.08,1:00:03.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题是他的尸体到底在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The question is, what happened to his body?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.36,1:00:09.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在他的锅炉室烧死他  把他的遗骸藏起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They burned him to death in his boiler room and they hid the remains.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.28,1:00:11.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁有可能知道遗骸藏在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who would know where they're hidden?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.20,1:00:14.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有一个人知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, only one man knows.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.20,1:00:18.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在他一定得开口了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's time for him to talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.20,1:00:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.32,1:00:24.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能把南希赶走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't take Nancy away from us!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.32,1:00:26.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能那么做  她是唯一能帮我们的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't! She's all we have!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.20,1:00:28.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你病了  克莉丝丹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a sick girl, Kristen.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.24,1:00:30.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想好起来  就得信任我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you wanna get better, you must trust me now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.32,1:00:38.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.52,1:00:41.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  - 带她去禁闭室  帮她注射镇定剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, no! - Take her to the quiet room and sedate her.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.24,1:00:45.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别激动  - 你这个笨贱人  你会害死我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take it easy. - You stupid bitch, you're killing us!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.28,1:00:47.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会害死我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're killing us!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.40,1:00:48.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.84,1:00:51.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会害死我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're killing us!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.40,1:00:52.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.12,1:00:55.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  大伙儿们  该睡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, everybody, back to bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.24,1:00:57.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.60,1:01:16.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.92,1:01:23.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是我的宝贝女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if it isn't my little girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.40,1:01:29.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的心肝来看爸爸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My baby come to see her daddy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.64,1:01:32.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好久不见了  - 对啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's been a long time. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.44,1:01:35.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你来了  坐吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're here, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.76,1:01:39.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来找我有什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did I do to, uh, get so lucky?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.72,1:01:43.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为你试着想忘记我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought that you were trying to forget me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.20,1:01:46.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是真的  想要遗忘的人是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not true. You're the one who's trying to forget.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.32,1:01:49.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.32,1:01:52.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你帮忙  爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need your help, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.60,1:01:53.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁格回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Krueger is back.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.84,1:02:02.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛莱迪·克鲁格死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fred Krueger is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.28,1:02:05.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直无法了解那一点  甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You always had a little trouble trying to understand that, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.64,1:02:07.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道他做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what he did.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.44,1:02:10.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他故技重施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's doing it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.16,1:02:16.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我们没见过面  朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe we've ever met, friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.36,1:02:19.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且这完全不关你的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I don't think this is any of your goddamn business.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.48,1:02:23.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为这次我们能阻止他  让他永远不会回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we can stop him this time. Stop him for good.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.96,1:02:27.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们得知道  他的遗骸藏在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we need to know where his bones were hidden.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.40,1:02:34.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这件事让我失去太多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've lost too much over this already.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.20,1:02:35.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不干了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm through with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.48,1:02:38.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过了这么久  还有人为此丢掉性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People are still dying after all this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.72,1:02:41.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别再逃避了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop running away from it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.32,1:02:45.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你欠我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You owe me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.56,1:02:48.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴能再见到你  小公主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was nice seeing you again, princess.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.84,1:02:52.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次早一点来找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next time, don't stay away so long.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.04,1:02:59.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.04,1:03:05.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 南希  - 我没事  给我一点时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nancy. - I'll be okay, just give me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.52,1:03:09.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是医院找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.44,1:03:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哥登医生  - 泰纶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dr. Gordon? - Taryn?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.20,1:03:26.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得立刻赶过来  是克莉丝丹  她严重失控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got to come right away. It's Kristen, she had a total shit attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.76,1:03:28.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希莫丝帮她注射镇定剂  还把她关在禁闭室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simms doped her up, put her in the quiet room.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.04,1:03:33.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希莫丝将克莉丝丹关在禁闭室过夜  还帮她注射镇定剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simms put Kristen in the quiet room for the night. They sedated her.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.40,1:03:34.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.88,1:03:37.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她无法保持清醒太久  她一个人被关在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She can't stay awake for long. She's all alone in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.08,1:03:39.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛莱迪会对她下手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freddy is gonna get her.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.36,1:03:41.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  大家别慌张  保持冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, none of you panic, just stay cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.52,1:03:42.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救兵立刻赶到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help is on the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.96,1:03:44.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快一点  - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just hurry. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.56,1:03:46.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们得立刻赶过去  - 你去吧  我得去找遗骸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We better get there now. - You go, I gotta get the remains.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.04,1:03:50.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是没有用的  - 我会跟他谈的  你去医院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's no use. You see him. - I'll talk, you get to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.24,1:03:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 试着说服希莫丝  - 她不会相信的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Make Simms understand. - She'll never.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.12,1:03:54.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得去救克莉丝丹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to get to Kristen somehow.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.44,1:03:55.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希  小心一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.92,1:04:14.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是尼尔·哥登  幸会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Neil Gordon. Pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.80,1:04:16.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我们正式介绍过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There, now we've met.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.96,1:04:18.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.60,1:04:21.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你在不在乎南希的死活  但我在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if you care whether Nancy lives or dies but I do!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.60,1:04:27.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟我去找遗骸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and I are going on a little scavenger hunt.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.12,1:04:47.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求祢  上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.88,1:04:50.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让我睡着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't make me sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.08,1:05:03.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来这里做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are we doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.28,1:05:07.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿  嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.64,1:05:09.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很快就出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't be long.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.24,1:06:02.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你以为你在做什么 - 呃…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you think you're doing? - Uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.64,1:06:04.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, uh, sorry. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.80,1:06:07.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的需要这个  我  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really need this. I got, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.20,1:06:10.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会赔偿你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll reimburse you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.80,1:06:13.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  我把驾照押在这里  我会回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, you can keep my driver's license. I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.80,1:06:31.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克思  我要见克莉丝丹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Max, I need to see Kristen.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.60,1:06:32.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.12,1:06:36.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤普森小姐  省省力气吧  希莫丝医生下了命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Miss Thompson, save your breath. Dr. Simms gave me specific instructions.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.96,1:06:39.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁都不能见克莉丝丹  特别是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one gets to see Kristen, especially you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.00,1:06:42.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克思  她需要我  她有危险  你得相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Max, she needs me, she's in danger. You got to believe me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.08,1:06:48.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我相信你是好意  但这些孩子差点没命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I really think you mean well, I do. But my kids have been dying off.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.60,1:06:50.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算没有希莫丝的命令  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And even if I didn't have orders from Simms...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.84,1:06:53.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不会让你靠近她  不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I wouldn't let you near her, no way.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.68,1:06:58.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  马克思  我了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Max, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.20,1:07:01.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我能跟其他孩子道别吗  - 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I say goodbye to the others? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.44,1:07:04.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的最后机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will be my last chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.24,1:07:08.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  给你五分钟  他们在视厅室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, you got five minutes. They're in the TV room.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.44,1:07:16.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跑到哪里去了  我们急到快发疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where have you been? We've been going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.32,1:07:18.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没时间多说  来吧  - 去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shh! There's no time for that, come on. - Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.76,1:07:19.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后一次团体治疗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our last group.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.92,1:07:22.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.84,1:07:36.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In there.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.36,1:07:41.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们知道在那里  谁都无法找到遗骸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We knew nobody would ever find it in that place.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.96,1:07:45.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连我都不确定我能不能找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure I can find it myself anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.27,1:07:51.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(潘尼兄弟废车厂)
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.16,1:08:19.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  遗骸就藏在废车厂里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, it's deep in the heart of the place.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.60,1:08:21.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it slow.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.88,1:08:40.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里只能直言不讳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Straight talk only in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.64,1:08:41.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克莉丝丹怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Kristen?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.92,1:08:44.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们无法接近她  我试过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't get to her, I tried.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.48,1:08:48.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜没有时间  学会怎么利用梦镜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was hoping we would have more time to learn to use the dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.32,1:08:50.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔伊陷在梦境里  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Joey is in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.45,1:08:52.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不论有没有我们  莉丝丹会进入梦境里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Kristen is going in with or without us.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.88,1:08:54.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们需要我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They need us.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.52,1:08:57.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说我们可以进入梦境找她  跟她合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean, we're gonna try to go in with her? To link up?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.88,1:08:59.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是唯一的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's now or never.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.40,1:09:02.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会跟你们开玩笑  这么做真的很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna kid you. This is as dangerous as it gets.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.44,1:09:05.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你们在这个梦境里死了  是真的会没命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you die in this dream, it's for real.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.28,1:09:07.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不愿意  可以不用加入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody has to go in that doesn't want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.28,1:09:13.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要加入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.56,1:09:15.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.68,1:09:20.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得进入梦境修理这个家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go kick the motherfucker's ass all over dreamland.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.52,1:09:21.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 太棒了 - 哈哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.76,1:09:25.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住  不论发生什么事  我们不可以走散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So remember, we have to stay together whatever happens.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.68,1:09:28.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有那样才能打败他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the only way we can beat him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.64,1:09:37.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  现在你们得放空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, clear your mind of everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.40,1:09:44.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想像自己在禁闭室里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Picture yourself in the quiet room...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.84,1:09:49.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柔和的白色墙壁  一片寂静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the soft white walls, the total silence.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.92,1:09:52.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能听到自己的心跳声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only the sound of your heart beating.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.52,1:09:55.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想像你们跟克莉丝丹在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Picture yourself there with Kristen.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.64,1:09:59.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要从五开始倒数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna count backwards from five.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.60,1:10:02.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倒数完毕  我们都会睡着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when I'm done, we'll all be asleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.28,1:10:05.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会一起出现在禁闭室里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll all be in the quiet room.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.08,1:10:09.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.12,1:10:14.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.68,1:10:17.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.68,1:10:21.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.52,1:10:25.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.72,1:10:30.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希  我就知道你会来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy, heh, I knew you would come.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.88,1:10:33.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我们会抛弃你吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't think we'd let you go in alone, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.48,1:10:35.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不可能  我们是一支团队  - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No way, we are a team. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.08,1:10:39.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  各位  乔伊需要我们  我能感觉到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, everybody, Joey needs us. I can feel him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.00,1:10:41.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.64,1:10:43.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该怎么找到他  克莉丝丹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we find him, Kristen?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.32,1:10:54.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待在房间中央\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay in the middle of the room!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.96,1:10:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不论发生什么事  别走散了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter what happens, stay together!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.84,1:11:01.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 救命啊  - 南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help! - Nancy!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.56,1:11:03.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.16,1:11:18.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甜心  你会吵醒邻居的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, you're gonna wake up the whole neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.48,1:11:23.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么还没睡  已经一点多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you still doing up? It's past 1.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.84,1:11:26.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.56,1:11:29.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想等你回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just thought I'd wait for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.80,1:11:32.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了  你该去睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm home. You can get to sleep now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.20,1:11:34.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  动作快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Andale.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.92,1:11:43.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that for?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.88,1:11:46.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很高兴你回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just glad you're home.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.68,1:11:54.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈  我做了好可怕的恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, I had the most awful dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.84,1:11:57.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊莲  波本威士忌放在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elaine, where do you keep the bourbon?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.48,1:11:59.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我立刻下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be right down.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.64,1:12:02.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克莉丝  我有客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kris, I've got a guest.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.52,1:12:05.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  妈妈  我不想一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, Mom, I just don't wanna be alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.96,1:12:07.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.32,1:12:11.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我问你波本威士忌放在哪里  - 妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I said, where is the fucking bourbon! - Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.40,1:12:15.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该听你妈妈的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should listen to your mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.64,1:12:17.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死  克莉丝丹  什么都你毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn it, Kristen, you ruin everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.64,1:12:19.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次我带男人回家你就搞破坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every time I bring a man home, you spoil it!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.80,1:12:23.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道心理医生是怎么说的  你只是想引人注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what your shrink says, you're just trying to get attention!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.32,1:12:50.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.80,1:12:57.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.28,1:12:59.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克莉丝丹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kristen!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.72,1:13:00.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.44,1:13:57.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎你回来  泰纶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome home, Taryn.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.68,1:14:00.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来很眼熟吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.36,1:14:03.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  混蛋  我们一决高下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, asshole, let's dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.52,1:14:17.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泰纶  泰纶  泰纶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taryn, Taryn, Taryn.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.00,1:14:22.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们为什么要互相残杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? Why should we fight?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.68,1:14:25.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟我是老朋友  记得吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're old friends, you and l, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.28,1:14:31.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来茫一下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get high.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.28,1:14:55.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真的是太骇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a rush.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.64,1:15:10.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人在吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.24,1:15:13.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙儿  你们在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.08,1:15:18.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人在吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is somebody there?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.00,1:15:38.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,威尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Will.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.52,1:15:42.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你似乎累了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.24,1:15:44.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.00,1:15:47.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  谢谢  我这样就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, thanks. I'm fine just the way I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.12,1:15:49.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你暂时可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For now maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.72,1:15:52.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但清醒之后  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when you wake up...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.96,1:16:00.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又得去坐轮椅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it's back in the saddle again.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.24,1:16:11.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My leg!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.24,1:16:17.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的轮椅来了  孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the chair for you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.72,1:16:19.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是大法师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the wizard master.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.60,1:16:23.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是大法师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the wizard master!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.32,1:16:37.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以精灵王子罗雷克之名  魔鬼快快退去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the name of Lowrek, Prince of Elves, demon, begone.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.12,1:16:50.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  孩子  我不相信童话故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, kid. I don't believe in fairy tales.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.76,1:16:57.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.20,1:17:00.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人在吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.96,1:17:04.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.08,1:17:09.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 克莉丝丹  - 南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kristen! - Nancy! Aah!
