Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.36,1:17:34.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 当然可以啊 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's stopping you? - Mm!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.96,1:17:36.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,酷啊  乔伊在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool. So where's Joey?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.92,1:17:39.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道  这里跟迷宫差不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. This place is Iike a maze.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.32,1:17:41.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么别再猜了  我们得大展身手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it's time to stop guessing and start messing.
