Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.88,1:17:49.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为你抓走那个哑巴  是件很光荣的事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you're hot shit with a mute kid, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.44,1:17:51.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我看看你能不能对付我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let me see you come get a piece of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.64,1:17:53.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁格  胆小鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Krueger! Pussy!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.24,1:17:56.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道他是个胆小鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew he was a little chicken.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.92,1:17:59.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
