Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.24,1:18:19.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不是那样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it does.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.28,1:18:35.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.12,1:18:37.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们准备好了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.28,1:18:41.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得去除掉那个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's snuff the sucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.76,1:19:29.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.96,1:19:32.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那辆凯迪拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Caddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.92,1:20:40.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.68,1:20:47.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我说过  我会告诉你遗骸藏在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I said I'd show you where the goddamn thing was.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.00,1:20:50.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我可没说我会留下来  - 我们有很多工作要做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I never said I'd stick around. - We've got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.04,1:20:54.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在胡说什么  - 你得参加一场葬礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you talking about? - You're about to attend a funeral.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.16,1:20:56.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一场迟来的葬礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One that's long overdue.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.28,1:21:38.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joey!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.68,1:22:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joey.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.76,1:22:06.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看  小宝贝们回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, all the little piggies come home.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.00,1:22:08.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放了他  克鲁格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him go, Krueger!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.20,1:22:12.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your wish is my command.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.36,1:22:13.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  - 乔伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! - Joey!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.00,1:23:31.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.92,1:23:40.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很强壮  他从来没有这么强壮过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's strong. He's never been this strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.92,1:23:45.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.88,1:23:51.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子的灵魂给了我力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The souls of the children give me strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.04,1:23:53.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不 - 啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Unh.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.84,1:24:00.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一向是来者不拒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always room for more.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.52,1:24:27.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是什么声音  - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's that? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.12,1:24:37.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注意听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.96,1:24:45.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里还有别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody else is out here.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.16,1:24:48.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.44,1:24:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里只有我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.04,1:25:30.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这该死的家伙埋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bury the fucking thing!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.76,1:25:47.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's really you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.80,1:25:54.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾杀过你  你这个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I killed you once before, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.28,1:26:41.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得往这边走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's try this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.56,1:26:43.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克莉丝丹  你能让我们脱离梦境吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kristen, can you pull us out?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.08,1:26:46.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们帮我注射镇定剂  我们被困在这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They sedated me. We're stuck here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.12,1:26:48.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前面没路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.00,1:26:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?
