Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.80,1:26:59.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许我该好好地招待你们一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps if there was more of me to spread around.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.16,1:27:45.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.60,1:28:00.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  我真的那么说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, did I say that?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.04,1:28:03.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你找到你的美梦力量了  兄弟  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You found your dream power, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.02,1:28:04.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你救了我们  乔伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saved us, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.44,1:28:07.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你吓跑他了  - 放我下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Man, you blew him away. - Put me down, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.32,1:28:10.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧  - 应该没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you okay? - I think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.04,1:28:12.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他离开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.20,1:28:17.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.08,1:28:20.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.76,1:28:32.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.00,1:28:35.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跨过边界来见你  小公主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've crossed over, princess.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.64,1:28:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跨过边界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crossed over?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.96,1:28:46.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开前得告诉你  我为我所做过的事感到抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't go without telling you how sorry I am for all the things I've done.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.88,1:28:49.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我非常爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.00,1:28:55.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会永远爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll always love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.76,1:29:09.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Die.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.52,1:29:17.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.48,1:29:30.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你是我的了  小女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're mine now, little piggy!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.28,1:29:33.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  - 啊 啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! - Unh, agh!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.24,1:29:59.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你  上帝  为了那些孩子跟南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, God, for the children, for Nancy.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.28,1:30:03.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尘归尘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ashes to ashes.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.00,1:30:09.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,土归土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dust to dust.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.52,1:30:16.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他的灵魂安息吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May the spirit rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.08,1:30:37.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会让你死的  我不会让你死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't let you die. I won't let you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.44,1:30:41.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要带你进入美梦  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna dream you into a beautiful dream...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.96,1:30:44.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到永远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...forever and ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.08,1:30:56.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们众民当时时倚靠他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust in him at all times, O people.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.48,1:31:01.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你面前倾心吐意  神是我们的避难所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pour out your hearts to him, for God is our refuge.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.72,1:31:05.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神啊  求你听我的呼求  侧耳听我的祷告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hear my cry, O God. Listen to my prayer.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.92,1:31:08.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我心里发昏的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the ends of the earth, I call to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.36,1:31:10.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要从地极求告祢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I call as my heart grows faint.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.28,1:31:13.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你领我到那比我更高的磐石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lead me to the rock that is higher than I.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.56,1:31:15.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你作过我的避难所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For you have been my refuge.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.40,1:31:18.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作过我的坚固台  脱离仇敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A strong tower against the foe.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.48,1:31:20.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要永远住在你的帐幕里  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I long to dwell in the tent forever
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.93,1:31:23.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要投靠在你翅膀下的隐密处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and take refuge in the shelter of your wings.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.56,1:31:25.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使我们安葬了南希  她的勇气跟精神与我们同在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even though we entrust Nancy to the earth,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.56,1:31:29.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的勇气跟精神与我们同在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}her courage and spirit shall remain with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.28,1:31:32.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为安慰我们的上帝说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the Lord, God, has comforted us saying...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.56,1:31:34.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凡是想救自己生命的  必丧掉生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that whoever finds his life will lose it...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.12,1:31:38.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但为我牺牲生命的  必得着生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and whoever loses his life for my sake will find it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.92,1:31:42.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们将永远活在天国的荣光里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They shall live forever in the glory of his kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.64,1:31:44.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿上帝保佑  降福于你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May the Lord bless you and keep you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.92,1:31:48.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿神使他的脸光照你  赐恩给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May the Lord make his face to shine down upon you and be gracious to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.04,1:31:51.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿神向你仰脸  赐你平安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May the Lord turn his face toward you and give you peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.96,1:31:53.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God.
